WEBVTT

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.480
<i>That feeling of stalling that appeared has once again disappeared.</i>

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:45.030
<i>But will come again, be it a minute, or a week...</i>

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:49.040
<i>If misfiring happens at this speed,
the engine will blow in the worst case scenario.</i>

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:52.010
<i>It won't be strange if anything happens right now.</i>

00:01:52.010 --> 00:01:55.250
<i>But you're also in the same boat as me,</i>

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:58.250
<i>as long as you keep running at this place.</i>

00:02:03.590 --> 00:02:09.690
<i>Stand By Me</i>

00:02:21.400 --> 00:02:23.050
<i>What a subtle turn.</i>

00:02:23.050 --> 00:02:26.110
<i>It's scary even for those who've raced for a long time.</i>

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:41.500
<i>His acceleration, braking and even
returning the steering wheel to position...</i>

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:42.800
<i>Everything is done with precise timing.</i>

00:02:53.970 --> 00:02:56.110
<i>Max boost at two bars,</i>

00:02:56.130 --> 00:02:57.400
<i>atmospheric pressure at one bar,</i>

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:59.700
<i>plus two bars of pressure at the turbine,</i>

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:07.000
<i>making the engine displacement three times
of 2600cc, simply calculated to 7800cc.</i>

00:03:07.950 --> 00:03:09.860
<i>It's a monster machine!</i>

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:18.410
<i>For these 10 years, I have been earnestly living with the R.</i>

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.860
<i>I wasn't wrong,</i>

00:03:25.860 --> 00:03:27.890
<i>neither did I lose anything.</i>

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:38.240
<i>This is me!</i>

00:03:38.240 --> 00:03:39.940
<i>There is no other place for me!</i>

00:03:45.140 --> 00:03:47.150
We've completely lost them.

00:03:47.150 --> 00:03:49.950
They're amazing, as expected of Z and Taka.

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:54.290
It's alright, if we continue driving, we'll surely meet them.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:55.860
You're right.

00:03:56.990 --> 00:03:57.740
Taka...

00:04:00.790 --> 00:04:02.700
<i>Yes, I'm sorry,</i>

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:04.380
<i>I'm now in the middle of covering a story.</i>

00:04:05.030 --> 00:04:06.900
<i>I'll call you back later.</i>

00:04:11.290 --> 00:04:14.420
<i>I was proposed to by this person.</i>

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:16.260
<i>I haven't given an answer yet.</i>

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:23.180
<i>Is it alright with you, Taka?</i>

00:04:26.110 --> 00:04:29.350
<i>That's the right decision, Mika.</i>

00:04:55.550 --> 00:04:59.390
<i>For a little while, there was a lag between engine rev and car speed.</i>

00:05:00.750 --> 00:05:03.350
<i>What happened? Why didn't you lower the gear?</i>

00:05:03.350 --> 00:05:06.110
<i>According to your rhythm, you should naturally be in 2nd gear.</i>

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:08.190
<i>Did something happen?</i>

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:12.110
<i>Engine? Transmission? No, probably drive system related?</i>

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:13.900
<i>No, it's the clutch.</i>

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:18.080
<i>That's why he used a higher gear to suppress
the engine rev, which is better for the clutch.</i>

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:24.910
<i>With such torque, he must have realized the limit of his clutch.</i>

00:05:25.990 --> 00:05:32.860
<i>In 5th gear, if the clutch slipped under such
high speed and load, it will instantly blow.</i>

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:43.480
<i>No matter how the settings have been
changed, you're still yourself, right Z?</i>

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:48.480
<i>You just want to run faster without being controlled by anybody.</i>

00:05:48.480 --> 00:05:52.510
<i>The settings are completed, but Akio...</i>

00:05:52.510 --> 00:05:55.740
<i>If we consider Kuroki's R as a digital monster,</i>

00:05:55.740 --> 00:05:58.150
<i>yours would be the dinosaur of the Jurassic period.</i>

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:01.350
<i>Yes, the eras they run in are different.</i>

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:03.200
<i>To begin with, it has always been impossible to beat him.</i>

00:06:09.790 --> 00:06:13.000
<i>That's fine. I'm fine with that.</i>

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:16.960
<i>If you give up right now, I won't race any more.</i>

00:06:17.500 --> 00:06:22.690
<i>I have only you. If you wish, run as much as you like, Z.</i>

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:27.690
<i>Not to survive, but live to the fullest.</i>

00:06:37.690 --> 00:06:40.480
<i>Tuning is a silly thing to do.</i>

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:44.950
<i>No matter how many flattering compliments
we say, it just cannot be justified.</i>

00:06:44.950 --> 00:06:47.910
<i>But at the same time, we cannot deny it.</i>

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.940
<i>An analog 600 horsepower turbo.</i>

00:06:52.940 --> 00:06:57.210
<i>It's already a miracle that you can run at this level.</i>

00:06:58.220 --> 00:07:00.140
<i>That engine, did you build it?</i>

00:07:01.210 --> 00:07:02.220
Yeah.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:06.480
<i>The same way you dismantled the engine,
why don't you dismantle the CPU as well?</i>

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:10.690
<i>This log which costs 500 yen will help you.</i>

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:16.550
<i>That was really true.</i>

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:20.450
<i>I analyzed the CPU data and put them into a new log.</i>

00:07:20.890 --> 00:07:23.910
<i>I could surely get a definite result and answer.</i>

00:07:24.650 --> 00:07:30.420
<i>After that, I believed the data that is sensed by
the sensors, and controlled the power digitally.</i>

00:07:31.910 --> 00:07:37.250
<i>However, my body now feels something
which the sensor cannot detect.</i>

00:07:37.250 --> 00:07:40.520
<i>Like the old tuners, I don't believe in that instinct.</i>

00:07:40.520 --> 00:07:43.430
<i>No, I shouldn't even believe it, but...</i>

00:07:46.440 --> 00:07:48.440
<i>This engine will blow.</i>

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:54.440
<i>If the worst abnormal combustion happens under this high
speed and load, the engine's internals will be shattered...</i>

00:07:54.440 --> 00:07:55.940
<i>Making it impossible to recover.</i>

00:07:56.890 --> 00:08:02.200
<i>If the engine blows, that means the R will die.</i>

00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:07.270
<i>This 800 horsepower engine, which was completed</i>

00:08:07.270 --> 00:08:10.290
<i>after many trial and error, will die...</i>

00:08:10.290 --> 00:08:14.200
<i>It's impossible that the bad parts of
the car will repair itself automatically.</i>

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:17.210
<i>If the symptom appears again, it's over.</i>

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:22.920
Here they come, both cars are on par.

00:08:25.690 --> 00:08:27.190
Such speed...

00:08:31.560 --> 00:08:35.310
<i>At the edge of my toes, I feel the
breath of the engine more than ever.</i>

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:39.690
<i>This won't last long.</i>

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:44.700
<i>Here I go, now is my only chance.</i>

00:09:04.890 --> 00:09:07.850
<i>There's no goal in a straight battle.</i>

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:11.350
<i>The choice of traffic lanes will make no big difference.</i>

00:09:11.350 --> 00:09:15.060
<i>Onlookers will not know who's faster.</i>

00:09:18.110 --> 00:09:22.100
<i>But those involved will surely know in an instant,</i>

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:26.820
<i>that who's really faster, that we'll always know.</i>

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:44.640
<i>It's not a blow due to knocking!</i>

00:09:47.430 --> 00:09:49.640
<i>The engine which took me many years to complete...</i>

00:09:51.010 --> 00:09:54.640
<i>My R is going to die...!</i>

00:10:03.090 --> 00:10:05.530
<i>The blow was momentary and the clutch is cut off.</i>

00:10:05.530 --> 00:10:08.320
<i>The worst engine lock has been avoided.</i>

00:10:12.560 --> 00:10:16.540
<i>Damn, at this rate I'll get stuck in the tunnel!</i>

00:10:32.600 --> 00:10:34.970
<i>At this rate, I'll really get stuck.</i>

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:47.620
Z...

00:11:07.800 --> 00:11:11.900
Hello, this is Kuroki.

00:11:11.900 --> 00:11:15.600
Excuse me, can you send a tow truck, please?

00:11:15.600 --> 00:11:18.790
My location is the place after getting off the Wangan entrance.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:22.940
Yes, around here, thank you. Then I'll be counting on you.

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:27.440
A tow truck will come shortly. You really saved me back there.

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:30.540
One more time, will you race me one more time?

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:32.200
It seems unclear as to who won.

00:11:32.200 --> 00:11:34.830
No, I already know well enough.

00:11:35.700 --> 00:11:38.790
Mine and R's hopes were fulfilled.

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:43.900
Well then, I'll be fine on my own from here on.

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.170
I'll also remain here.

00:11:46.460 --> 00:11:48.550
Reina-chan, please go ahead with Akio-kun.

00:11:48.550 --> 00:11:50.440
Y-Yeah.

00:11:59.900 --> 00:12:01.940
Akio-kun's Z has stopped moving?

00:12:01.940 --> 00:12:05.750
Yeah, it's as if the tension was cut off.

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:09.340
After it raced with Kuroki-san, it just
suddenly could not move any more.

00:12:09.340 --> 00:12:13.700
It was just beside boss Yamamoto's house, therefore
we waited for him until morning and left it there.

00:12:13.700 --> 00:12:17.450
Both cars spent all their energy and were completely burnt up.

00:12:17.450 --> 00:12:19.970
I guess it was a shock for both too.

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:23.310
Yes, especially Taka...

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:26.480
That R means everything to him for the past 10 years.

00:12:26.480 --> 00:12:31.220
It can't be recovered and no one can help him.

00:12:31.220 --> 00:12:36.370
No one can say anything for him too.
As a tuner, this is his own problem.

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:38.050
Is there anything we can do?

00:12:40.820 --> 00:12:42.870
Even the flywheel was affected?

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.310
Yeah, quite.
<i>In a car's clutch, the flywheel connects to the engine and a clutch plate connects to the transmission.</i>

00:12:45.310 --> 00:12:47.260
Oh, how about Kitami?

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:48.310
He said to leave it to you.

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:52.610
Then, I will remake it as I like.

00:12:53.530 --> 00:12:55.070
That's good, I want to see it.

00:12:55.680 --> 00:12:59.030
Z's clutch band. Nothing was left at all.

00:12:59.030 --> 00:13:01.270
I'm surprised it could even run in this condition.

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:03.200
It could withstand it.

00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:07.060
Kitami-san has always said that it was that kind of car.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:09.900
Hello.

00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:15.420
Akio, the flywheel should be able to be reconnected,

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:17.750
but the cover and clutch band have to be completely changed.

00:13:17.750 --> 00:13:18.650
So, how you want it?

00:13:18.650 --> 00:13:20.940
Parts and stuff, shall I prepare and build them?

00:13:20.940 --> 00:13:22.930
Can you get back the original parts?

00:13:22.930 --> 00:13:26.560
No problem, since it's just a simple twin plate.

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:30.440
Surprisingly, for this car, we didn't use any special part.

00:13:30.440 --> 00:13:35.350
Why not increase the capacity with a special triple plate?

00:13:35.350 --> 00:13:37.410
Actually, the torque will stack, right?

00:13:37.410 --> 00:13:42.460
Probably, I set it this way with Kitami-san.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:44.200
I'm alright with the same capacity as before.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:48.040
If it is increased, are you afraid that
the transmission will be damaged?

00:13:48.040 --> 00:13:50.710
No, that's not what I meant.

00:13:50.710 --> 00:13:55.510
I'm alright with the current capacity, as long as I can drive properly.

00:13:56.300 --> 00:14:00.680
After the run with Kuroki-san's R, although it's unclear who won...

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:03.730
but one thing I clearly understand now.

00:14:04.290 --> 00:14:07.440
Z will surely follow... me.

00:14:19.020 --> 00:14:23.320
It looks alright around the camshaft, right?
But if you look carefully, it's warped.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:25.330
<i>A camshaft is an apparatus often used in piston engines to operate the poppet valves.</i>

00:14:25.640 --> 00:14:28.330
When I was in my third year of university...

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:34.340
I had my engine blown for the first time
and unconsciously I was almost crying.

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:39.840
Recklessly boosting up. This was the result of my ignorance.

00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:43.140
I was just happy with a powerful engine,

00:14:43.140 --> 00:14:45.890
and couldn't hear the screams coming from behind.

00:14:49.250 --> 00:14:51.480
Without the money to repair it at a shop,

00:14:51.480 --> 00:14:55.480
I read maintenance manuals and overhauled my car by myself.

00:14:55.480 --> 00:14:59.290
At that time, I promised myself that
I won't let my engine blow again.

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:02.200
But I failed.

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:09.090
But because of this, I realized something important.

00:15:10.540 --> 00:15:13.040
That Z and this car taught me.

00:15:14.130 --> 00:15:17.940
At the moment the engine blew, I understood clearly...

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:21.170
that there's a moment which no sensor can sense.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:28.140
Not only the sound, but the temperature and breath too...

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:29.700
I understood it very well.

00:15:31.060 --> 00:15:34.940
As expected, this is the only world for me to live in.

00:15:34.940 --> 00:15:38.150
I will go as far as I can. I won't hesitate any more.

00:15:38.600 --> 00:15:42.360
With a positive attitude and looking straight ahead.

00:15:43.030 --> 00:15:46.120
That's why... from today onwards, don't come here any more.

00:15:46.990 --> 00:15:49.870
You should go live together with somebody who is in your world.

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:55.090
And please be happy. I'll continue living in my world.

00:16:08.290 --> 00:16:11.330
This... Mika, it's still alive!

00:16:11.330 --> 00:16:12.210
It's alright,

00:16:12.210 --> 00:16:13.490
if that's the case, the crack can also...

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:18.700
That you and I are living in different worlds, who exactly said that?

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:19.980
Mika...

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:26.070
I know clearly, this is the only place for me, beside you.

00:16:27.960 --> 00:16:29.790
But I am...

00:16:31.130 --> 00:16:33.530
I am crazy about speed my whole life.

00:16:33.530 --> 00:16:37.910
You'll never be really happy. Are you still alright with this?

00:16:37.910 --> 00:16:42.710
After all this, what are you saying? I still want to be with you.

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:47.760
I finally understood that I am happy when I am with you.

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:54.010
Even while I was away from you, in my
heart I was always thinking only about you.

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:58.190
Although we were in different places
physically, but our hearts were connected.

00:16:58.190 --> 00:17:00.270
Taka, you should know this too.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:05.490
At first, I was thinking of casting off my uncertainty,
therefore I wrote the article about you.

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:08.200
But everything became upside down.

00:17:09.330 --> 00:17:14.850
When I looked at you standing right next
to you, I realized my honest feelings.

00:17:23.540 --> 00:17:27.230
I remembered about this hand countless times.

00:17:27.230 --> 00:17:33.730
And every time I remember, I missed the
world where I was with you and felt like crying.

00:17:33.730 --> 00:17:34.940
Mika...

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:43.350
I got fed up with the R200 Club, and frankly, I was depressed.

00:17:43.350 --> 00:17:47.740
At that time, I met BlackBird and that Z...

00:17:47.740 --> 00:17:49.870
And you...

00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:54.710
For me... as expected for me.

00:17:56.660 --> 00:17:57.710
I know.

00:17:59.240 --> 00:18:02.380
Will you be with me together?

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:04.380
Yes...

00:18:19.980 --> 00:18:21.990
Did you hear about Z and Kuroki?

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:26.900
I heard, it finished when Kuroki's R blown
before entering the Kaitei Tunnel.

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:31.240
Yeah, and Z's clutch was damaged and could not move after that.

00:18:31.240 --> 00:18:37.710
By the way, Kitami-san, I took leave
as requested, but where are we going?

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:39.950
If we go any further, we'll enter Tohmei Highway.

00:18:39.950 --> 00:18:45.170
It's fine, continue going, and after that drive 250km to the west.

00:18:45.560 --> 00:18:46.920
Is it around Osaka?

00:18:47.430 --> 00:18:50.940
That's right, there's a man in Osaka I want you to meet.

00:18:52.500 --> 00:18:56.160
I'm going to sleep for a while. When we arrive, wake me up.

00:18:56.160 --> 00:18:57.140
Got it.

00:19:14.670 --> 00:19:16.230
Shige-san, good evening.

00:19:17.210 --> 00:19:20.040
Oh, you came, Eiji.

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.510
You're still the same.

00:19:24.510 --> 00:19:25.720
By the way, Eiji,

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:30.410
last week at the Beltway you chased
after a demo car of Keireishin, right?

00:19:31.210 --> 00:19:35.760
A S15. You shouldn't make fun of professional tuners.

00:19:35.760 --> 00:19:38.760
They're doing it since it's their work duty.

00:19:38.760 --> 00:19:40.990
Ah, that was my younger brother.

00:19:40.990 --> 00:19:42.650
Younger brother?

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:46.900
Eh, Maki changed his car to an Evo 6 last month.

00:19:46.900 --> 00:19:49.740
But there were stickers of Works R pasted.

00:19:49.740 --> 00:19:51.950
I gave him permission.

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:54.420
That brat also switched to a Lan Evo?

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:57.840
Now, you two are the invincible Lan Evo brothers!

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:02.330
Actually, we're not Evo brothers,
but brothers with different mothers.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:05.400
What are you saying?

00:20:05.400 --> 00:20:10.760
But it really worries me, since he's different
from me, and behaves very recklessly.

00:20:10.760 --> 00:20:14.470
You too, I don't want to hear that coming from you.

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:20.890
By the way, Shige-san, it's been bothering
me since just now, what is that?

00:20:22.230 --> 00:20:28.100
This is an exhaust manifold of a Porsche Turbo.
I felt nostalgic and took it out.

00:20:28.100 --> 00:20:28.960
Meaning?

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:32.360
An old friend call me this afternoon,

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:35.200
and said he'll come all the way from Tokyo to see me tonight.

00:20:35.200 --> 00:20:36.700
From Tokyo?

00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:40.950
Maki, where are you now?

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:43.090
I'm at the ramp of Tamade.

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:45.950
I can't decide if I should go to the Beltway or not.

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:49.340
After I switched to an Evo, everyone seemed to slow down...

00:20:49.340 --> 00:20:51.460
Nobody can catch up to me any more.

00:20:51.920 --> 00:20:54.180
For the time being, I'll go to the Beltway first.

00:20:54.180 --> 00:20:56.540
Got it, I'll leave now.

00:20:56.540 --> 00:20:57.680
Speak of the devil...

00:20:58.470 --> 00:21:01.060
I'll be going out for a while.

00:21:12.360 --> 00:21:17.200
Don't worry, I will take care of Maki.

00:21:37.100 --> 00:21:38.730
You're slow, brother!

00:21:51.130 --> 00:21:53.110
Trying to overtake me suddenly here, brother!

00:21:57.740 --> 00:22:02.150
<i>Maki, you must remember starting from the insignificant things.</i>

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:07.660
<i>This place has its own rules. I want you to understand that.</i>

00:22:10.170 --> 00:22:13.270
He's fast, what a crazy driving!

00:22:13.270 --> 00:22:16.560
<i>But, it's not easy for me to teach you.</i>

00:22:16.560 --> 00:22:19.170
<i>No matter how much I tell you, it's impossible.</i>

00:22:20.260 --> 00:22:23.910
<i>What you should observe and what you should listen to,</i>

00:22:23.910 --> 00:22:26.680
<i>and where you should go...</i>

00:22:26.680 --> 00:22:29.190
<i>You still haven't understood anything at all.</i>

00:22:29.190 --> 00:22:31.690
<i>You're just not afraid of death.</i>

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:36.610
Damn it!

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:42.420
<i>Look Maki, you cannot accelerate any more.</i>

00:22:42.420 --> 00:22:47.410
<i>The car won't go fast just with the right setting.
And much less with only skill.</i>

00:22:47.410 --> 00:22:51.210
<i>You must really know the car and drive properly.</i>

00:22:51.750 --> 00:22:56.210
<i>This kind of basic things, you can't even grasp at all.</i>

00:22:56.620 --> 00:23:00.430
<i>I was once like you, you will learn from your bad experiences,</i>

00:23:00.430 --> 00:23:03.120
<i>no matter how trivial it is, you must remember them.</i>

00:23:04.430 --> 00:23:08.440
<i>I want to properly each you this kind of things.</i>

00:23:12.480 --> 00:23:13.940
Damn you...!
